  "html": "<html lang=\"en\" style=\"color-scheme: light; overflow-y: scroll;\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <script>\n        // Document positions belong to the Compose route cache, including browser Back/Forward.\n        history.scrollRestoration = \"manual\";\n    </script>\n    <title>Compose Foundation — Components</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg?v=kotlin-gradient\">\n    <link type=\"text/css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body style=\"text-align: center; align-content: center; height: calc(5470px + 100vh);\">\n    <div id=\"compose-root\"><div style=\"position: relative;\"><div style=\"position: relative;\"></div><div style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px;\"></div></div></div>\n    <script type=\"application/javascript\" src=\"webApp.js\"></script>\n\n\n</body></html>",
  "ariaSnapshot": "- button \"Open navigation\"\n- button \"Home\"\n- button \"Search documentation\"\n- button\n- button \"Toggle theme\"\n- button \"New\"\n- text: Chip\n- button \"Copy\"\n- text: A selectable tag, commonly used for filters or multi-select choices. Kotlin extension\n- button \"Kotlin\"\n- text: \"1 Chip(label = \\\"Kotlin\\\", onClick = {})\"\n- button \"View Code\"\n- heading \"Installation\":\n  - text: Installation\n  - button\n- button\n- text: build.gradle.kts // build.gradle.kts — commonMain.dependencies implementation(\"com.toutiaoyan.compose:ui:0.3.37\")\n- button \"Copy\"\n- heading \"Usage\":\n  - text: Usage\n  - button\n- button\n- text: 1 import com.toutiaoyan.compose.ui.components.chip.Chip\n- button \"Copy\"\n- text: \"1 2 3 4 5 6 var selected by remember { mutableStateOf(false) } Chip( label = \\\"Kotlin\\\", selected = selected, onClick = { selected = !selected }, )\"\n- button \"Copy\"\n- heading \"Composition\":\n  - text: Composition\n  - button\n- button\n- text: Chip ├── leadingIcon (optional slot) └── label\n- button \"Copy\"\n- heading \"Kotlin extension\":\n  - text: Kotlin extension\n  - button\n- button\n- text: \"Chip is a Kotlin extension of this catalog, not an official shadcn/ui component. shadcn only ships Badge, which is a static label, so there is no Base UI reference page or upstream recipe list to mirror. The API below is the current Kotlin source of truth: a selectable tag built from the same tokens as Button/Badge.\"\n- heading \"Selectable\":\n  - text: Selectable\n  - button\n- button\n- text: Pass selected and toggle it from onClick; the default variant follows the selection state.\n- button \"Kotlin\"\n- text: \"1 2 var selected by remember { mutableStateOf(false) } Chip(label = \\\"Kotlin\\\", selected = selected, onClick = { selected = !selected })\"\n- button \"View Code\"\n- heading \"Selected\":\n  - text: Selected\n  - button\n- button\n- text: Pin the selected look with ChipVariant.Selected.\n- butt